# S Demo Script (2–3 minutes)

1. `s version` — show 3.4.0
2. `s new demo` — project created
3. Open main.s — greet + json
4. `s run demo/main.s`
5. `s check demo/main.s`
6. Show calc.s or loops_fns.s
7. `s release demo --key=demo` — .sbx ship
8. `S_SHIELD_KEY=demo s run demo/dist/demo.sbx`
9. Close: Simple · Safe · Supreme
